.TH GRINTION-SECURITY 1 "November 2026" "Grintion-OS" "Security Administration"
.SH NAME
grintion-security \- Security hardening profile manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B grintion-security
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B grintion-security
manages and applies defense-in-depth system security profiles for Grintion-OS, orchestrating firewall policies, AppArmor enforcement modes, USB data-blocking, and audit logging.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBstatus\fR
Show active profile and compliance state.
.TP
\fBlist\fR
List available security profiles (workstation, server, kiosk, air-gapped).
.TP
\fBset\fR \fIPROFILE\fR
Apply specified profile rules to the system.
.TP
\fBverify\fR
Validate system compliance against active profile constraints.
.SH AUTHORS
Grintion-OS Core Team.

